  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "RelationshipTuple currently stores the output of toString on the datatype URI, then re-creates the URI in more places than the String value is needed alone.  It should privilege the more common use case in serialization/deserialization over the relatively rare individual relationship updates.",
